        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17272572?u=309627a92b42befd42a36a7244c9de3388386630&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Adds <a href=\"https://github.com/Pumpkin-MC/Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>, a Minecraft server<br>\nimplementation written entirely in Rust, focused on performance and<br>\nconfigurability. There's no tagged release upstream yet, so this is<br>\npackaged from a pinned commit.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also adds a NixOS service module (<code class=\"notranslate\">services.pumpkin-mc</code>) with typed options<br>\nfor Java/Bedrock/RCON networking, PvP, and whitelist settings, plus a<br>\nfreeform <code class=\"notranslate\">settings</code> escape hatch for the rest of <code class=\"notranslate\">pumpkin.toml</code>. RCON<br>\nsecrets are handled via a <code class=\"notranslate\">passwordFile</code> option only; plaintext passwords<br>\nin <code class=\"notranslate\">settings</code> are rejected at eval time.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> aarch64-linux (cross-compiled from x86_64-linux via <code class=\"notranslate\">pkgsCross.aarch64-multiplatform</code>, not natively tested)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>. (<code class=\"notranslate\">nixosTests.pumpkin-mc</code>)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
